<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Taiwan construction basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Taiwan construction basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Wednesday it issued 5.0 million American style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of four Taiwanese construction stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Cathay Construction	    2   shares</p>
<p> Pacific Construction	   3   shares</p>
<p> Prince Housing		   2   shares</p>
<p> Kingdom Construction	    1   shares</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$7.77	 PREMIUM	 9.68 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$2.88	 GEARING	 3.37x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  10.Oct.97     PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG    MIN EXER LOT  100</p>
<p> SPOT		  US$9.71 or 266.8 NTD</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
